<title>FRANCE: French gvt could agree EMU deal before June 19-Kok.</title>
<headline>French gvt could agree EMU deal before June 19-Kok.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch Prime Minister Wim Kok said on Tuesday the French government said it could agree the EMU stability pact before June 19 when it was due to be presented to the French National Assembly.</p>
<p>&quot;The French government told us they do not have to wait for the presentation before the National Assembly,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
